  {
   "id": "memorrha-109573@1.6",
   "gameId": "memorrha-109573",
   "displayName": "Update 1.6",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-01-20T16:15:30.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Dear Memorrhians,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "we present the long awaited Update V1.6 with the manual savegame feature.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Furthermore the regional pricing for some countries were adjusted.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "IMPORTANT: Savegames from 1.5 and under are NOT compatible with the 1.6! To checkout the older version install the Update 1.5 branch in your steam library!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Patchnotes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Added a manual savegame option to allow manual savegames (Finally!)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reduced CPU load by 40% and RAM usage by over 50%",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improve loading and saving times",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Major Upgrade to the 2020.3.38f1 Unity Engine",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a physic bug in the elevator",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed two door bugs in the temple",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bunch of savegame bugs that could occur with the old savegame system",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted controller configurations and updated it to support even more controllers",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "A lot of small visual glitches, bugfixes and unnecessary loadings of objects was improved",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Why did it take us so long to do this?",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "One reason the port to consoles took so long is the game's savegame system and the way Memorrha loads into RAM. So we rewrote the entire Savegame-System and changed the level loading behavior. Unfortunately this was very time consuming - but now it's done!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "With the V1.6 update it will now be possible to save manually. This is really a big step and we are happy that we can finally make this possible. The old savegames will not be compatible with the V1.6 update, so we have provided a V1.5 on Steam beta branch.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "One more really important request",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We as a small indie studio rely a lot on reviews, our heart and soul goes into this project.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you liked Memorrha it would REALLY help us if you leave a positive review on Steam.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you very much! ːsteamthumbsupː",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The StickyStoneStudio Team -",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
