  {
   "id": "memorrha-109573@1.2",
   "gameId": "memorrha-109573",
   "displayName": "Update 1.2",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2019-10-12T10:20:57.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Dear Memorrhians,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We just released our second big update fixing some issues that were reported to us during the last week.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks a lot to all the players who have supported us diligently in troubleshooting and are still doing so.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Always running option added to the game",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased the possible FOV to 100 and adjusted the value related to camera clipping behavior",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "When emptying an amphora with liquid the animation is now stopped when the player drops the amphora or moves away from the container",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "When picking up an amphora that is currently filling up the animation now stops instead of continuing until the amphora is full",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted culling triggers in the abyss section to lessen object popup",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted doors in the abyss section to not create slight collider bumps in the floor anymore",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted the elevator to prevent objects placed on the elevator from stuttering during elevator movement and stopped the walking sound from constantly starting up in fast succession",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added certain safeguard measures for several elevators to prevent players from breaking their game if they manage to circumvent the respective colliders",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted the credits",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved the charge sound in the energy color puzzle",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a particle bug that would cause particles to continue emitting under certain conditions instead of properly fading",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Further adjustments to world colliders",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Corrected certain texture bugs in the cellar",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "The master volume slider setting now does not reset when choosing between graphical preset profiles",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a controller related bug that would allow players to open the main menu when already being in the options menu: The next update will focus on mine cart puzzles, stay tuned!: As always, thank you so much for playing Memorrha! ːreheartː",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
